# CODEOWNERS
#
# This repository is a fork of davidpirogov/toon-llm, and `cxmlabs/koomo`
# consumes it as a pinned production dependency. A change that lands here can
# reach the application the moment somebody moves that pin, so main carries the
# same review requirement as the application repositories.
#
# Available GitHub teams:
#   @cxmlabs/engineering      — all engineers
#   @cxmlabs/sre              — SRE
#
# Rules are matched bottom-up — the last matching rule wins.

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Default — all engineers
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*                    @cxmlabs/engineering

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Packaging — SRE.
#
# These files decide what actually ships into the application: the dependency
# set, the resolved versions, and the CI that builds them. A git dependency is
# fetched by commit SHA and never passes through the PyPI index, so it is not
# covered by the 7-day package quarantine that `koomo` applies to indexed
# packages. Review here is the compensating control.
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
pyproject.toml       @cxmlabs/sre
uv.lock              @cxmlabs/sre
tox.ini              @cxmlabs/sre
.github/             @cxmlabs/sre
